  ) VALUES (
    'f4e6075a-fc11-54a9-91e5-6a385a0f9441'::uuid, 'nih-chestxray14-workshop',
    'STAND-IN (synthetic) for NIH ChestX-ray14: workshop slice (200 chest radiographs)',
    'SYNTHETIC STAND-IN, NOT DIAGNOSTIC. These are procedurally generated placeholder images, not radiographs: no NIH image is included. They stand in for the slice described below until the real files have been prepared, and the source and terms describe the dataset that will replace them. A 200-image slice of the NIH ChestX-ray14 collection, prepared for the December 2026 radiology workshop: frontal chest radiographs of adults, one per patient, balanced by sex and age band, at most 1024 px on the longest side. The reference labels of the evaluation task are held by the evaluation service and are not published. The reference label (airspace opacity present or absent) is invented for the stand-in and has no relation to the placeholder images. Source: https://nihcc.app.box.com/v/ChestXray-NIHCC. The images are provided by the NIH Clinical Center, which is the data provider. Cite: Xiaosong Wang, Yifan Peng, Le Lu, Zhiyong Lu, Mohammadhadi Bagheri, Ronald M. Summers. ChestX-ray8: Hospital-scale Chest X-ray Database and Benchmarks on Weakly-Supervised Classification and Localization of Common Thorax Diseases. IEEE CVPR 2017, pp. 3462-3471.',
    '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099', 'PUBLIC', 'PUBLISHED',
    'OPEN', 'OK', ARRAY['X-ray'],
    '1.1', payload, ARRAY['DUO_0000004']::text[], CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
  )
